{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_017ogRz9ii2QV6JvY7uevVab", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t# 002 · 选题\n2\t\n3\t给一个新的爽文故事定选题。这个故事以后可以写成网文，也可以拍成竖屏短剧。\n4\t\n5\t这一步只定选题，不写大纲和正文。\n6\t\n7\t交付（写成文件，放在当前目录）：\n8\t\n9\t1. 一句话卖点\n10\t2. 选题说明：题材，写给谁看，主角和对手，核心冲突，开篇钩子，爽点从哪来，打算写多长、为什么撑得住\n11\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "2b1c607d-66f7-4ad8-9f15-5b7fa5f3f5f1", "uuid": "6046a664-eeb0-4904-b8c8-d12d348134a5", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T23:31:02.336Z", "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_017ogRz9ii2QV6JvY7uevVab", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "rule"}}]}
